# ==============================================================================
# NGSkillForge Learning Platform - Frontend Environment Variables Template
# ==============================================================================
# For Render Static Site deployment:
# Add these variables under your Static Site's "Environment" tab in the Render Dashboard.
# NOTE: Changing any VITE_* variable requires a REBUILD of the Static Site on Render
# because Vite embeds these values into the compiled JavaScript at build time.
#
# DO NOT place backend secrets (JWT secret, DB password, SMTP password, Cloudinary secret,
# Groq key) in frontend environment variables.
# ==============================================================================

# Backend API Base URL
# In local development: Leave empty or use '/api' to use Vite's dev server proxy to localhost:5000.
# On Render Static Site: Set to your deployed Render Web Service API URL:
# Example: https://ngskillforge-learning-platform.onrender.com/api
VITE_API_URL=https://ngskillforge-learning-platform.onrender.com/api
